 "source_instruction": "i m looking for a 8 no. vinyl acetate man's sandals",
 "query": "I swear my neighbor\u2019s golden retriever has been plotting a grand escape all week\u2014yesterday I caught him dragging a whole patio lounge cushion over to the fence line like he was building a ramp to clear the pickets, and he had the most smug little look on his face when I called him out on it. I stopped by the corner bakery on my walk home last night and they were selling those salted caramel apple hand pies I\u2019ve been craving since last fall, but the second I got in line the person ahead of me bought the last three, and the cashier said they won\u2019t bake another batch until Friday. I\u2019ve also been trying to train my own rescue pup to stop stealing my socks out of the laundry basket, but every time I think I\u2019ve hidden the basket high enough he finds a way to nudge a chair over to climb up, and yesterday he paraded around the living room with my favorite fuzzy polka dot sock hanging out of his mouth like he\u2019d won a trophy. I\u2019m browsing the men\u2019s sandals section right now and need a pair that uses vinyl chloride in its construction, size 8, plus I want to grab a matching suede insole to go with them for under $40. I\u2019ve been scrolling for 20 minutes and can\u2019t seem to narrow it down, so if you can pull up options that check all those boxes that\u2019d be great. I don\u2019t really care about the strap style as long as those core things line up, I just need something I can wear to walk the dog this weekend.",
